<title>ARGENTINA: TABLE - Argentine grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Argentine grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimate to July 16 of 1996/97 shipments, export commitments and purchases by exporters in indicated crop years</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
